                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "- Internal audit reports (confidential).\n- Industry whitepapers on operational risk management.\n- Case studies from financial institutions (anonymized).\n- Regulatory guidelines on fraud prevention.",
